k", "children": [{"_type": "span", "marks": [], "text": "توفر الوقت، تحسن الفهم، وتزيد الإنتاجية، كما أنها سهلة الاستخدام ولا تتطلب خبرة متقدمة بالذكاء الاصطناعي."}], "markDefs": [], "style": "normal"}], {"_key": "3c4d583cc5cf", "_type": "code", "code": "from transformers import pipeline\n\n# Initialize the summarization pipeline\nsummarizer = pipeline(\"summarization\", model=\"facebook/bart-large-cnn\")\n", "language": "python"}, {"_key": "8e4be5e54a5e", "_type": "code", "code": "text = \"\"\"\nArtificial intelligence is transforming industries worldwide. From healthcare to finance, \nAI is helping professionals make better decisions faster. Machine learning models can now \nanalyze medical images, predict financial trends, and even generate human-like text. \nHowever, with great power comes great responsibility. We must ensure AI systems are \ndeveloped ethically and transparently.\n\"\"\"\n\nsummary = summarizer(text, max_length=50, min_length=25, do_sample=False)\nprint(summary[0]['summary_text'])", "language": "python"}, {"_key": "b59745599e4e", "_type": "code", "code": "from transformers import pipeline\n\ndef summarize_text(text, max_length=100, min_length=30):\n    \"\"\"\n    Summarize any text using BART model\n    \n    Args:\n        text (str): The text to summarize\n        max_length (int): Maximum length of summary\n        min_length (int): Minimum length of summary\n    \n    Returns:\n        str: The summarized text\n    \"\"\"\n    summarizer = pipeline(\"summarization\", model=\"facebook/bart-large-cnn\")\n    summary = summarizer(text, max_length=max_length, min_length=min_length, do_sample=False)\n    return summary[0]['summary_text']\n\n# Example usage\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    article = \"\"\"\n    Your long article text here...\n    \"\"\"\n    \n    result = summarize_text(article)\n    print(\"Original length:\", len(article.split()))\n    print(\"Summary:\", result)\n    print(\"Summary length:\", len(result.split()))\n", "lan